# Build/install state the tester provisions. Ignored not for tidiness but for
# SPEED: `clone_or_pull` runs `git clean -fd`, which deletes untracked-and-not-
# ignored directories — so on a brownfield repo (the only kind that gets this
# appended block) the venv, the browsers and node_modules were wiped before every
# single Test-gate round and rebuilt from scratch. The greenfield template has
# carried these entries all along; this block did not.
.tester_venv/
.tester_build/
.tester_app/
node_modules/
